00:11:13.465 --> 00:11:14.633
they'll all start folding.

252
00:11:21.056 --> 00:11:22.431
We're going
to kill Colonel Markham

253
00:11:22.432 --> 00:11:24.184
as he leaves the British
Consulate tomorrow.

254
00:11:26.978 --> 00:11:29.021
So. here's how this goes.

255
00:11:29.022 --> 00:11:31.482
The Semtex gets loaded carefully

256
00:11:31.483 --> 00:11:34.568
