339
00:15:07.949 --> 00:15:09.950
The only one way to learn
how to do this. Jimmy.

340
00:15:09.951 --> 00:15:11.328
is to do it.

341
00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.122
So. you're not gonna
give me any money?

342
00:15:15.123 --> 00:15:16.333
No.

343
00:15:17.667 --> 00:15:19.418
But I got a guy.

344
00:15:19.419 --> 00:15:20.919
Ruby Stein.

345
00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.172
He shylocks for everybody.
He's very connected.

346
00:15:23.173 --> 00:15:25.300
-Oh. yeah?
-Yeah. He'll lend you the money.

347
00:15:26.259 --> 00:15:29.011
Just be sure. you borrow money
from Ruby Stein...

348
00:15:29.012 --> 00:15:30.012
