353
00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:53.702
Mr. Stein. you'll get
your money back. plus your vig.

354
00:15:53.703 --> 00:15:55.871
And I'm even willing
to add 10% on top of that.

355
00:15:55.872 --> 00:15:58.874
Oh. that's very generous of you.
I don't care if it's 100%.

356
00:15:58.875 --> 00:16:00.376
You don't have any collateral!

357
00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:02.086
You know what collateral is?

358
00:16:02.087 --> 00:16:03.754
-Yes.
-Good! Then you know

359
00:16:03.755 --> 00:16:05.714
-you don't have any!
-Mr. Stein.

360
00:16:05.715 --> 00:16:08.092
you're the biggest
loan shark in the city.

361
00:16:08.093 --> 00:16:09.218
You have the money.

362
00:16:09.219 --> 00:16:10.886
Of course I've got the money.

363
00:16:10.887 --> 00:16:13.222
Because I don't lend it
to Irish punks off the street

364
00:16:13.223 --> 00:16:15.684
