making outrageous demands.

365
00:16:16.976 --> 00:16:18.477
Sorry. fellas.

366
00:16:18.478 --> 00:16:20.313
Go elsewhere.
I'm a very busy man.

367
00:16:27.278 --> 00:16:30.030
I'm a decorated war veteran.

368
00:16:30.031 --> 00:16:31.740
I ain't no punk.

369
00:16:31.741 --> 00:16:34.410
Well. good for you.
Thank you for your service.

370
00:16:34.411 --> 00:16:36.663
You're not getting
any of my money.

371
00:16:39.124 --> 00:16:40.124
It's all right.

372
00:16:44.796 --> 00:16:46.631
My boss is Eamon Sweeney.

373
00:16:49.759 --> 00:16:50.969
Eamon Sweeney?

374
00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.179
This money's for him?

375
00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:55.306
Why isn't he here?

376
00:16:56.391 --> 00:16:57.933
He. uh.

377
00:16:57.934 --> 00:16:59.893
