willing to give us?

383
00:17:15.702 --> 00:17:17.287
I tell you what.
I'll give you half.

384
00:17:20.248 --> 00:17:22.958
That's... That's very kind
of you. Mr. Stein.

385
00:17:22.959 --> 00:17:25.210
but that's only 50 grand.

386
00:17:25.211 --> 00:17:26.795
I mean. you must
be able to do more.

387
00:17:26.796 --> 00:17:28.839
Plus double my vig.

388
00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:31.508
You guys are obviously getting
into a very risky business.

389
00:17:31.509 --> 00:17:33.594
one that might very well
get you killed

390
00:17:33.595 --> 00:17:34.928
before I get repaid.

391
00:17:34.929 --> 00:17:36.289
Or I might have
to kill you myself.

392
00:17:40.351 --> 00:17:42.269
Take it or leave it. fellas.

393
00:18:15.678 --> 00:18:17.513
Hey. handsome.

394
00:18:17.514 --> 00:18:18.931
Lookin' for fun?

395
00:18:18.932 --> 00:18:20.558
Yeah. get in.

396
00:18:27.232 --> 00:18:28.982
Pull into the parking lot.

397
00:18:28.983 --> 00:18:31.401
Twenty for a BJ.
40 for full service.

398
00:18:31.402 --> 00:18:33.862
Alice? Alice Hamilton?

399
00:18:33.863 --> 00:18:35.614
What is this?

400
00:18:35.615 --> 00:18:37.241
Officer Keenan.

401
00:18:37.242 --> 00:18:39.785
Remember me?
Hey. hey. hey. hey.

402
00:18:39.786 --> 00:18:41.370
Relax.

403
00:18:41.371 --> 00:18:43.247
You're not in trouble.

404
00:18:43.248 --> 00:18:46.084
I just wanna talk to you.
I'm not lookin' to bust you.

405
00:18:47.836 --> 00:18:49.127
You remember?

406
00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:50.212
I interviewed you
in the hospital

407
00:18:50.213 --> 00:18:51.714
after your face got cut.

408
00:18:53.883 --> 00:18:55.176
What do you want?

409
00:18:58.429 --> 00:19:00.181
I know who did this to you.

410
00:19:01.516 --> 00:19:03.517
Do you now?

411
00:19:03.518 --> 00:19:05.018
Yeah.

412
00:19:05.019 --> 00:19:06.187
You know how I know?

413
00:19:07.272 --> 00:19:08.773
Not 'cause you told anyone.

414
00:19:09.774 --> 00:19:11.483
Because I overheard
Dukey Sullivan

415
00:19:11.484 --> 00:19:14.027
braggin' about it at the 596.

416
00:19:14.028 --> 00:19:15.737
And I'll tell you
somethin' else.

417
00:19:15.738 --> 00:19:17.949
you're not the first woman
he's raped and cut.

418
00:19:19.492 --> 00:19:21.410
But maybe you could be the last.

419
00:19:21.411 --> 00:19:23.120
You know why?

420
00:19:23.121 --> 00:19:25.831
'Cause I'm gonna put
that fucker away for so long

421
00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:28.083
he never hurts anyone again.

422
00:19:28.084 --> 00:19:29.294
But I need your help.

423
00:19:30.628 --> 00:19:32.630
I don't know any Dukey Sullivan.

424
00:19:36.384 --> 00:19:37.468
Let me see your arm.

425
00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.473
You're still on the junk. huh?

426
00:19:44.893 --> 00:19:46.560
You sick?

427
00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:55.235
Here.

428
00:19:55.236 --> 00:19:56.904
I'm gonna let you get well.

429
00:19:56.905 --> 00:19:58.280
You can fix.

430
00:19:58.281 --> 00:20:00.198
But first. I need you
to sign something.

431
00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:01.199
All right?

432
00:20:03.786 --> 00:20:04.996
Good.

433
00:20:17.592 --> 00:20:19.635
Bridget?

434
00:20:19.636 --> 00:20:20.845
Yeah?

435
00:20:22.639 --> 00:20:24.432
One sugar. no milk.

436
00:20:25.975 --> 00:20:28.518
-You remembered that.
-Of course I remembered.

437
00:20:28.519 --> 00:20:29.853
Only you and my ma
are crazy enough

438
00:20:29.854 --> 00:20:31.481
not to drink tea with milk.

439
00:20:35.068 --> 00:20:36.653
What?

440
00:20:38.488 --> 00:20:39.864
It's just that...

441
00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.992
when I asked you
to hide that weapon...

442
00:20:43.952 --> 00:20:45.661
I never dreamed
you'd end up on my team.

443
00:20:45.662 --> 00:20:48.121
Oh. c'mon. you...

444
00:20:48.122 --> 00:20:50.583
this was part
of your plan. right?

445
00:20:51.709 --> 00:20:53.961
'Cause you could have
hidden that weapon anywhere.

446
00:20:53.962 --> 00:20:55.545
I have to admit.

447
00:20:55.546 --> 00:20:57.005
it's a good reason to see you.

448
00:20:57.006 --> 00:20:58.549
And it worked.

449
00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:02.053
I'm here for only one reason.

450
00:21:03.179 --> 00:21:04.222
Don't forget that.

451
00:21:05.264 --> 00:21:06.683
Of course.

452
00:21:07.684 --> 00:21:09.444
That's why I'm letting you
man the explosion.

453
00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:15.274
So. my only concern is
civilian casualties.

454
00:21:16.234 --> 00:21:17.609
That never bothered you
in London.

455
00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:18.819
But this is America.

456
00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:21.572
and it has bothered me
every day since.

457
00:21:24.367 --> 00:21:26.201
Have you thought about
how this might play out

458
00:21:26.202 --> 00:21:27.452
in the American press?

459
00:21:27.453 --> 00:21:28.954
The American public

460
00:21:28.955 --> 00:21:30.205
are ignorant to what happens

461
00:21:30.206 --> 00:21:31.748
in Northern Ireland
every fuckin' day.

462
00:21:31.749 --> 00:21:33.500
It's time they woke up.

463
00:21:33.501 --> 00:21:35.377
If we're as vicious as Markham.

464
00:21:35.378 --> 00:21:37.629
they may not understand
who the real villain is.

465
00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:40.340
You may lose American sympathy.

466
00:21:40.341 --> 00:21:41.925
Are you fuckin' committed
to this or not?

467
00:21:41.926 --> 00:21:44.928
-Yeah. I am.
-Then fuck America.

468
00:21:44.929 --> 00:21:46.888
I only care what
the Irish think.

469
00:21:46.889 --> 00:21:48.348
When Colonel Markham is dead.

470
00:21:48.349 --> 00:21:50.149
there'll be dancing
on the streets of Belfast.

471
00:21:58.693 --> 00:22:01.611
Ooh. you boys
can't get enough. can you?

472
00:22:01.612 --> 00:22:04.614
What can I say?
People love your stuff. Nelson.

473
00:22:04.615 --> 00:22:06.491
So. we'll take another two keys.

474
00:22:06.492 --> 00:22:09.786
Two keys?
That's one hundred thousand.

475
00:22:09.787 --> 00:22:12.414
You see how fast I do that?

476
00:22:12.415 --> 00:22:14.833
It's like I'm a math genius.

477
00:22:14.834 --> 00:22:17.794
But you see. the thing is.
we only have 50 grand.

478
00:22:17.795 --> 00:22:19.296
But I'm good for the other half.

479
00:22:19.297 --> 00:22:21.548
Hmm. You're good
for the other half?

480
00:22:21.549 --> 00:22:23.829
We have a deal set up that
would get you paid immediately.

481
00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:27.179
We friends?

482
00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:30.515
Sure.
I'd like to think so.

483
00:22:30.516 --> 00:22:33.518
Fuck you.
I don't have no friends.

484
00:22:33.519 --> 00:22:36.897
And I'm not your mami.
I'm not your papi.

485
00:22:36.898 --> 00:22:38.774
I'm not your girlfriend.

486
00:22:38.775 --> 00:22:40.776
So I don't lend you shit.

487
00:22:40.777 --> 00:22:42.736
It's cash up front.

488
00:22:42.737 --> 00:22:45.489
And if you ever ask me
to front you again...

489
00:22:45.490 --> 00:22:47.241
you're never gonna see me again.

490
00:22:48.284 --> 00:22:50.744
I'm sorry. I must not be
hearing you right.

491
00:22:50.745 --> 00:22:52.704
'cause you got
that thick fuckin' accent.

492
00:22:52.705 --> 00:22:54.873
I don't know
what you're saying. but...

493
00:22:54.874 --> 00:22:57.502
but you're gonna front us
the coke. right. chico?

494
00:23:01.047 --> 00:23:02.757
Don't get
fucking excited. fellas.

495
00:23:03.674 --> 00:23:05.175
You're in our neighborhood now.

496
00:23:05.176 --> 00:23:07.302
Hey. hey. It's all right.
It's all right.

497
00:23:07.303 --> 00:23:08.470
We're just negotiating.

498
00:23:08.471 --> 00:23:10.055
A word of advice.

499
00:23:10.056 --> 00:23:11.556
maybe don't flash those things

500
00:23:11.557 --> 00:23:13.059
in a fucking Irish bar. hm?

501
00:23:17.772 --> 00:23:19.981
So. how 'bout this. Nelson?

502
00:23:19.982 --> 00:23:23.318
One key for 50 grand.

503
00:23:23.319 --> 00:23:24.487
I think I got the math right.

504
00:23:28.783 --> 00:23:30.409
Cash business we can do.

505
00:23:32.495 --> 00:23:33.579
Do you have the money?

506
00:23:55.184 --> 00:23:56.893
Next time.

507
00:23:56.894 --> 00:23:58.312
this one better stay home.

508
00:23:59.981 --> 00:24:02.316
